{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You find yourself doomed to a life in perdition after making a deal with the devil Mephisto. With no other choice but to do the devil's bidding, it's your job to clean the dungeons covered with blood.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO INFERNAL CLEANER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Infernal Cleaner</i></strong> is a relaxing first-person cleaning simulation game. Except, you're tasked with cleaning blood and filth stains from gory and demented dungeons in Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/892bb6e6527e8113e9dbefe2ea32396c.poster.avif?t=1756867902\" width=780 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/892bb6e6527e8113e9dbefe2ea32396c.webm?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/892bb6e6527e8113e9dbefe2ea32396c.mp4?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast blood specks off the ancient dungeon walls. Scrub grime off the the stairways to torture chambers. There's a type of hell here for everybody...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/fe056a77156f6382882a667554d1fb84.poster.avif?t=1756867902\" width=780 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/fe056a77156f6382882a667554d1fb84.webm?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/fe056a77156f6382882a667554d1fb84.mp4?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use demonic tools to clean layers of <strong>blood and grime</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy\u00a0<strong>unconventional cleaning techniques</strong> to get the job done. Make use of the environment for time-effective cleaning solutions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/637374558d3829bb50300cda4353a7e3.poster.avif?t=1756867902\" width=780 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/637374558d3829bb50300cda4353a7e3.webm?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/637374558d3829bb50300cda4353a7e3.mp4?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual</strong> satisfying gameplay that can be played at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal </strong>hell environments from different time periods.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/9398983b5ed8d834be90cae1890bc7af.poster.avif?t=1756867902\" width=780 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/9398983b5ed8d834be90cae1890bc7af.webm?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/9398983b5ed8d834be90cae1890bc7af.mp4?t=1756867902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 